'''Illyasviel''' (遠坂 凛) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 6.6 Update|Version 6.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Illyasviel
|image = E 374.png
|appearance = [[Fate/Stay Night: Heaven's Feel Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000¢ - 11,850¢
}}

==Enemy==
She has higher stats than [[Rin Tohsaka (Enemy)|Rin Tohsaka]], but isn't a major threat, as she has low attack power and slow attack rate, decent range and HP, with an inconsistent [[Slow]] ability. Overall only a threat to early game players.

==Strategy==
Illyasviel has a Multi-Hit that reaches 400 range, so most backliners like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] cleanly outrange her. Her Slow only has a 30% activation chance, so it can be considered a non-issue in most circumstances.

